{"sha": "47ebd29f415865ffaefe14bc086b9a877126ffd861bff0904987e340f1f88c00", "body": ["\\section*{第 \\ref{ch:g12:radioactive-decay} 章 --- 放射性衰变}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g12:radioactive-decay:1}", "$T_{1/2} = \\ln 2/\\lambda = 0.693/\\num{1.0e-6} = \\qty{6.9e5}{s}", "\\approx 8.0$ 天 --- 碘-131 的“时钟”。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g12:radioactive-decay:2}", "$T_{1/2} = 3.8 \\times \\num{86400} = \\qty{3.28e5}{s}$；", "$\\lambda = 0.693/\\num{3.28e5} = \\qty{2.1e-6}{s^{-1}}$；", "$\\mathcal A = \\lambda N = \\num{2.1e-6} \\times \\num{1.0e10} \\approx", "\\qty{2.1e4}{Bq}$。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g12:radioactive-decay:3}", "$\\dd N/\\dd t = N_0(-\\lambda)e^{-\\lambda t} = -\\lambda N$ ---", "方程成立；$N(0) = N_0 e^0 = N_0$；", "$N(T_{1/2})/N_0 = e^{-\\lambda \\ln 2/\\lambda} = e^{-\\ln 2} =", "\\tfrac12$。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g12:radioactive-decay:4}", "$90$ 年 $= 3\\,T_{1/2}$：$\\mathcal A = \\num{4.0e5}/2^3 =", "\\qty{5.0e4}{Bq}$。$300$ 年 $= 10\\,T_{1/2}$：", "$\\mathcal A = \\num{4.0e5}/1024 \\approx \\qty{3.9e2}{Bq}$。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g12:radioactive-decay:5}", "斜率 $= (18.85 - 20.00)/10 = -0.115$，因此", "$\\lambda = \\qty{0.115}{h^{-1}} = 0.115/3600 = \\qty{3.2e-5}{s^{-1}}$；", "$T_{1/2} = 0.693/0.115 = 6.0$ 小时 --- 锝-99m。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g12:radioactive-decay:6}", "$N = (1.0/226) \\times \\num{6.02e23} = \\num{2.7e21}$；", "$T_{1/2} = 1600 \\times \\num{3.156e7} = \\qty{5.05e10}{s}$，因此", "$\\lambda = \\qty{1.37e-11}{s^{-1}}$；", "$\\mathcal A = \\lambda N \\approx \\qty{3.7e10}{Bq}$ --- 一居里，即", "玛丽·居里所用一克镭的放射性活度。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g12:radioactive-decay:7}", "两者都预期剩下一半：$10$，以及 \\num{1.0e20}。计数的涨落", "$\\sim 1/\\sqrt{n}$：对 $10$ 次衰变，约为 $30\\%$ ---", "$7$ 或 $13$ 并不出人意料；对 \\num{1.0e20}，约为", "$10^{-10}$。只有大样本才能在", "可测量的精度上服从该规律。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g12:radioactive-decay:8}", "$m = 140 \\times \\num{1.2e-4} = \\qty{1.7e-2}{g}$；", "$N = (0.0168/40) \\times \\num{6.02e23} = \\num{2.5e20}$。", "$\\lambda = 0.693/(\\num{1.25e9} \\times \\num{3.156e7}) =", "\\qty{1.76e-17}{s^{-1}}$；$\\mathcal A = \\lambda N \\approx", "\\qty{4.4e3}{Bq}$ --- 约为人体总放射性活度的一半（其余大部分", "来自碳-14）。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g12:radioactive-decay:9}", "$\\lambda = 0.693/6.0 = \\qty{0.116}{h^{-1}}$。在 $15$ 小时时：", "$\\mathcal A = 500\\,e^{-0.116 \\times 15} = 500 \\times 0.177 \\approx", "\\qty{88}{MBq}$。低于 \\qty{1}{MBq} 时：", "$t = \\ln(500)/0.116 \\approx \\qty{54}{hours}$ --- 约为 $9$", "个半衰期。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g12:radioactive-decay:10}", "木炭：$3.4/13.6 = \\tfrac14$，恰为 $2$ 个半衰期：", "$t = \\num{1.15e4}$ 年。骨骼：", "$t = \\num{5730} \\times \\ln(1/0.30)/\\ln 2 = \\num{5730} \\times 1.74", "\\approx \\num{1.0e4}$ 年。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g12:radioactive-decay:11}", "$\\lambda = 0.693/3.8 = \\qty{0.182}{d^{-1}}$；", "$t = \\ln(100)/\\lambda = 4.61/0.182 \\approx 25$ 天（约 $6.6$", "个半衰期）。但周围花岗岩和土壤中的铀衰变链会", "持续产生氡：一次性通风会在", "数周内被抵消，因此通风必须长期进行。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g12:radioactive-decay:12}", "由 $N/N_0 = e^{-\\lambda t}$ 得 $\\lambda t = \\ln(N_0/N)$，而", "由 $\\lambda = \\ln 2/T_{1/2}$ 得 $t = T_{1/2}\\ln(N_0/N)/\\ln 2$。此处", "$t = \\num{5730} \\times \\ln(20)/\\ln 2 = \\num{5730} \\times 4.32", "\\approx \\num{2.5e4}$ 年。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g12:radioactive-decay:13}", "$N_{\\mathrm K} = N_0 e^{-\\lambda t}$ 且", "$N_{\\mathrm{Ar}} = N_0 - N_{\\mathrm K}$，因此", "$N_{\\mathrm{Ar}}/N_{\\mathrm K} = e^{\\lambda t} - 1$。比值为 $3.0$：", "$e^{\\lambda t} = 4$，故 $\\lambda t = 2\\ln 2$，", "$t = 2\\,T_{1/2} = \\num{2.5e9}$ 年。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g12:radioactive-decay:14}", "$\\ln \\mathcal A = 5.99$、$5.42$、$4.84$、$4.26$、$3.69$：每隔", "\\qty{60}{s} 下降 $0.57$--$0.58$ --- 近似一致，呈直线。斜率：", "$\\lambda = 2.30/240 = \\qty{9.6e-3}{s^{-1}}$；", "$T_{1/2} = 0.693/\\num{9.6e-3} \\approx \\qty{72}{s}$。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g12:radioactive-decay:15}", "(a) $2^{-10} \\approx \\num{1e-3}$。(b) $(1/2)^8 = 1/256 \\approx", "0.4\\%$。(c) 预期为 $1000/8 = 125$ --- 但该规律对于", "哪些原子会衰变并不作答：它精确预言群体的行为，却完全无法预言个体。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{pb:g12:radioactive-decay:1}", "\\textbf{1.} 与大气的交换（进食、呼吸）使", "该比例始终维持在大气中的数值；死亡后摄入停止，", "衰变便起主导作用。", ""]}